usage: prepare_clone_permit.py [-h] --url URL [--expires-hours EXPIRES_HOURS]
                               [--max-mutations MAX_MUTATIONS] --ack ACK
                               --out OUT

Prepare local expiring disposable-clone authorization

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --url URL             Loopback origin of disposable clone
  --expires-hours EXPIRES_HOURS
  --max-mutations MAX_MUTATIONS
  --ack ACK             Exact string: I CONFIRM THIS IS A DISPOSABLE CLONE
  --out OUT
